WEBVTT

00:00:11.960 --> 00:00:14.710
How can you bring yourself to go that far?

00:00:16.080 --> 00:00:18.330
Because I want her to be happy.

00:00:18.880 --> 00:00:21.670
Big... brother.

00:00:28.290 --> 00:00:30.580
G-good morning, Instructor.

00:00:31.080 --> 00:00:32.540
Good morning.

00:00:33.170 --> 00:00:35.630
Milady, you reacted quite well.

00:00:35.630 --> 00:00:36.790
Jeez!

00:00:36.790 --> 00:00:40.000
Haven't I told you not to wake me
up like you're trying to kill me?!

00:00:40.670 --> 00:00:42.630
This is also part of your training.

00:00:43.880 --> 00:00:44.790
Well now!

00:00:45.290 --> 00:00:48.130
The academy's training trip starts today.

00:00:48.380 --> 00:00:50.580
Have you finished packing your bags?

00:00:51.080 --> 00:00:52.540
Sure have.

00:00:52.540 --> 00:00:54.540
Please don't treat me like a child.

00:02:42.040 --> 00:02:44.830
No Guidance Above nor Below

00:02:44.080 --> 00:02:48.710
In the first place, Instructor, I don't think
you show enough consideration to ladies!

00:02:49.000 --> 00:02:51.920
If you're going to come, then you have to tell me so!

00:02:51.920 --> 00:02:54.580
I have to get myself dressed and ready and so on!

00:02:54.790 --> 00:02:56.420
What's with the leisurely attitude?

00:02:56.710 --> 00:02:59.670
You think an assassin will wait for you
to get dressed and ready?

00:03:00.000 --> 00:03:02.750
But it's not like you're an assassin, Instructor, are you?!

00:03:03.830 --> 00:03:05.830
That's a drug with a dose for just one person.

00:03:05.960 --> 00:03:07.580
Think carefully before using it.

00:03:09.330 --> 00:03:10.380
Instructor?

00:03:10.960 --> 00:03:13.540
No, you are quite right, milady.

00:03:13.540 --> 00:03:15.000
Ah! There you are!

00:03:15.750 --> 00:03:17.210
I was just looking for you!

00:03:17.500 --> 00:03:18.960
Do you have some business with me?

00:03:19.330 --> 00:03:20.130
Er...

00:03:20.580 --> 00:03:22.630
I wouldn't say "business."

00:03:22.880 --> 00:03:23.790
But uh...

00:03:24.420 --> 00:03:25.540
sure enough,

00:03:26.210 --> 00:03:27.210
um...

00:03:27.540 --> 00:03:29.790
I was thinking you're the only one for this!

00:03:30.000 --> 00:03:30.880
Huh?

00:03:31.380 --> 00:03:32.540
Hey, Kuu...

00:03:33.000 --> 00:03:36.460
What do you say about marrying me?

00:03:41.250 --> 00:03:42.080
In short...

00:03:42.750 --> 00:03:45.830
your father went and decided
on a husband-to-be for you,

00:03:46.290 --> 00:03:47.380
and in order to decline you said,

00:03:47.380 --> 00:03:49.710
"I already have a lover who I've promised my future to."

00:03:49.710 --> 00:03:50.710
Right?

00:03:50.750 --> 00:03:52.250
Exactly!

00:03:52.250 --> 00:03:53.830
In Papa's mind, you see,

00:03:53.830 --> 00:03:58.250
we're already living together and
kissing about 100 times a day.

00:03:58.460 --> 00:04:00.750
Have you considered you're taking this too far?

00:04:01.080 --> 00:04:03.130
Well, uh...

00:04:03.420 --> 00:04:06.960
Once I started exaggerating, I became unable to stop.

00:04:08.130 --> 00:04:10.000
"L-l-living together"?

00:04:10.000 --> 00:04:11.790
Lita, calm down.

00:04:12.250 --> 00:04:15.750
I owe Papa a debt of gratitude
so big I could never repay it,

00:04:16.170 --> 00:04:17.960
so I didn't feel free to just refuse.

00:04:19.250 --> 00:04:20.630
So, please!

00:04:20.630 --> 00:04:23.000
For the time being, pretend to be my lover!

00:04:25.000 --> 00:04:26.670
I suppose I have no choice.

00:04:27.250 --> 00:04:28.170
Fine, then.

00:04:28.170 --> 00:04:29.210
Really?!

00:04:29.500 --> 00:04:30.960
That's great!

00:04:31.710 --> 00:04:33.170
Thank you, Kuu!

00:04:33.170 --> 00:04:35.920
There's nothing at all great about it!

00:04:40.380 --> 00:04:42.500
Kuu, you've got such muscular arms!

00:04:42.880 --> 00:04:45.460
I-I'd say they're clinging to each other a bit too tightly!

00:04:45.460 --> 00:04:46.210
Agreed.

00:04:46.330 --> 00:04:48.290
Instructor Rose is getting carried away!

00:04:48.540 --> 00:04:52.460
Oh, I'm sorry, Lady Melida and Lady Elise.

00:04:52.460 --> 00:04:54.130
For now, I'm in the leading role.

00:04:54.460 --> 00:04:55.750
Right, darling?

00:04:55.750 --> 00:04:56.790
Yeah...

00:04:56.880 --> 00:04:58.460
Hup!

00:04:59.460 --> 00:05:00.500
Milady?

00:05:00.750 --> 00:05:01.500
Ah!

00:05:01.500 --> 00:05:05.330
Lady Melida, he treats you affectionately at the mansion -
isn't that enough?!

00:05:05.830 --> 00:05:06.880
How deplorable!

00:05:08.040 --> 00:05:10.040
What a corruption of public morals!

00:05:10.040 --> 00:05:11.250
Unbelievable!

00:05:11.250 --> 00:05:12.920
Making eyes at him in a licentious manner like that...

00:05:14.420 --> 00:05:16.540
That's Ms. Stachie from the board of directors...

00:05:16.960 --> 00:05:17.580
Hmph.

00:05:24.290 --> 00:05:27.000
Pleased to meet you, Miss Elise Angel.

00:05:27.250 --> 00:05:31.250
I have heard a great deal about
your exploits as a Paladin.

00:05:32.830 --> 00:05:35.750
Completely unlike that "incompetent talented girl"...

00:05:36.460 --> 00:05:39.500
with her shabby Status that is unbecoming of a Paladin.

00:05:39.880 --> 00:05:40.630
In addition...

00:05:40.630 --> 00:05:43.460
To think the attendant she's brought is
a man of marriageable age.

00:05:44.880 --> 00:05:46.790
Director Stachie, he is-

00:05:53.540 --> 00:05:56.460
A garden of sweet-smelling young ladies!

00:05:56.460 --> 00:06:01.250
I've again found myself at the doorway
to as-yet-unknown heroic tales!

00:06:04.630 --> 00:06:06.710
Marquis Blossom Pricket!

00:06:08.040 --> 00:06:09.920
Oh, Rosetti!

00:06:09.920 --> 00:06:11.500
My beloved daughter!

00:06:13.000 --> 00:06:14.630
C'mon, stop it, Papa.

00:06:14.830 --> 00:06:16.420
You're embarrassing me.

00:06:18.580 --> 00:06:21.960
Thank for taking the trouble to come, Lord Pricket.

00:06:23.630 --> 00:06:24.750
Why, of course!

00:06:25.210 --> 00:06:26.880
For this particular training trip,

00:06:26.880 --> 00:06:30.630
there can be no guide more suitable than myself!

00:06:31.130 --> 00:06:33.790
Instructor Rose, why is your father here at the academy?

00:06:34.130 --> 00:06:37.250
Because the destination for the training trip is Shangarta.

00:06:37.880 --> 00:06:42.460
Shangarta is Instructor Rosetti
and Marquis Pricket's hometown.

00:06:42.540 --> 00:06:45.290
Hey, why do you know that, Kuu?!

00:06:45.540 --> 00:06:46.960
Due to my line of work.

00:06:47.500 --> 00:06:49.670
Speaking of Marquis Blossom Pricket,

00:06:50.000 --> 00:06:51.960
there's no one in the field who doesn't know him.

00:06:51.960 --> 00:06:54.080
After all, he's an authority on genetic engineering.

00:06:54.670 --> 00:06:56.580
What a remarkable man...

00:06:57.210 --> 00:07:00.710
By the way, my beloved daughter,
I have some happy news.

00:07:00.790 --> 00:07:01.670
What is it?

00:07:01.670 --> 00:07:04.920
It has been decided that during this training trip
St. Friedeswiede is going on,

00:07:04.920 --> 00:07:09.330
our town will play host to your wedding ceremony!

00:07:09.420 --> 00:07:11.250
WHAT?!

00:07:11.710 --> 00:07:12.750
Wait?!

00:07:12.750 --> 00:07:14.540
When did that come up for discussion?!

00:07:14.540 --> 00:07:16.500
I never heard a thing about it!

00:07:16.500 --> 00:07:18.790
I do not intend to get married!

00:07:18.880 --> 00:07:22.540
Oh, Rosetti... my lovely minx of a daughter!

00:07:22.830 --> 00:07:25.750
I'm dating my Kuu over here!

00:07:26.210 --> 00:07:28.210
Don't just ignore my feelings on the matter!

00:07:28.210 --> 00:07:30.420
It's just as she says, Marquis Pricket.

00:07:30.630 --> 00:07:31.750
So you're the guy?

00:07:31.920 --> 00:07:34.250
How dare you seduce my daughter!

00:07:36.330 --> 00:07:37.420
Are you...?!

00:07:37.540 --> 00:07:38.880
Pa-Papa...?

00:07:38.880 --> 00:07:39.830
No, I'm mistaken!

00:07:39.830 --> 00:07:41.420
There's no way that could be!

00:07:41.420 --> 00:07:43.880
What's the matter, Lord Pricket?

00:07:46.210 --> 00:07:47.420
Excuse me.

00:07:47.420 --> 00:07:50.540
You bear a striking resemblance to
someone I knew who's now dead.

00:07:50.630 --> 00:07:51.790
A dead person?

00:07:53.250 --> 00:07:55.420
It was about seven or eight years ago...

00:07:55.420 --> 00:08:00.040
There had just been an atrocious
mass murder in our town.

00:08:00.250 --> 00:08:01.670
Something like that happened there?

00:08:01.920 --> 00:08:02.750
Ah, I see...

00:08:03.000 --> 00:08:05.580
You have no recollection of that time.

00:08:05.880 --> 00:08:10.460
The mastermind of the crime was considered
to be a boy who was 12 at the time.

00:08:10.460 --> 00:08:13.000
I can see the face of that boy in this man here.

00:08:19.000 --> 00:08:19.750
Come now!

00:08:20.250 --> 00:08:22.830
The briefing for the training trip is about to begin!

00:08:23.290 --> 00:08:24.920
Please head to the great hall immediately.

00:08:24.920 --> 00:08:25.880
Understood.

00:08:26.210 --> 00:08:27.170
Lord Pricket.

00:08:27.540 --> 00:08:29.330
We'll be heading over this way.

00:08:29.330 --> 00:08:31.290
Ah, excuse me.

00:08:35.580 --> 00:08:37.790
Instructor, we should be going, too.

00:08:37.960 --> 00:08:40.420
I'm very sorry, milady.

00:08:40.420 --> 00:08:41.040
Huh?

00:08:41.540 --> 00:08:43.500
I'm not feeling great.

00:08:43.710 --> 00:08:46.000
So I will be excusing myself from the assembly.

00:08:46.170 --> 00:08:47.880
Um, Instuctor?

00:08:48.170 --> 00:08:52.420
Are you perhaps letting the things Director Stachie
and the Marquis said bother you?

00:08:52.920 --> 00:08:54.460
No, milady.

00:08:58.670 --> 00:08:59.630
You see...

00:08:59.960 --> 00:09:02.000
So long as you acknowledge
and appreciate me, milady...

00:09:02.500 --> 00:09:05.330
I'm able to believe in my own worth.

00:09:07.250 --> 00:09:08.040
Well, then...

00:09:13.670 --> 00:09:14.920
Instructor...

00:09:22.960 --> 00:09:26.960
Something about Instructor's
demeanor back there seemed a bit off.

00:09:27.630 --> 00:09:29.630
I think it was bothering him, after all.

00:09:29.630 --> 00:09:31.630
Lita, what's wrong?

00:09:32.380 --> 00:09:34.250
You've looked spaced out for a while now.

00:09:35.460 --> 00:09:40.290
I wonder why my instructor won't
talk to me about anything...

00:09:41.420 --> 00:09:42.250
Lita...

00:09:45.830 --> 00:09:49.210
It seems I can't help but worry about my instructor.

00:09:49.210 --> 00:09:50.710
I'm gonna try and catch up with him!

00:09:54.670 --> 00:09:55.880
Good grief...

00:09:56.170 --> 00:09:58.830
Why do I have to be an instructor at the academy?!

00:09:58.830 --> 00:10:01.040
It's all that damn brute's fault!

00:10:02.330 --> 00:10:04.670
Hey, Angel, where you going?

00:10:04.670 --> 00:10:06.420
The assembly's still in session, you know.

00:10:06.420 --> 00:10:08.330
Ah, Instructor Laqua...

00:10:08.540 --> 00:10:09.380
Stay back!

00:10:10.830 --> 00:10:12.170
Hey, what's wrong?

00:10:12.380 --> 00:10:13.830
N-nothing...

00:10:14.170 --> 00:10:17.080
Damn Infernal Blue-Fire Ice King!

00:10:17.330 --> 00:10:18.170
Huh...?

00:10:18.830 --> 00:10:20.250
What was that voice?

00:10:20.460 --> 00:10:21.250
"Voice"?

00:10:21.630 --> 00:10:23.000
What're you talking about?

00:10:23.380 --> 00:10:25.750
Instructor Laqua, you didn't hear that just now?

00:10:26.330 --> 00:10:29.210
NOO!

00:10:38.880 --> 00:10:42.080
She's only fallen unconscious -
there are no external injuries.

00:10:42.080 --> 00:10:42.710
Instructor?!

00:10:43.670 --> 00:10:44.960
What in the world's going on?

00:10:45.630 --> 00:10:46.830
I don't know.

00:10:47.460 --> 00:10:49.580
I myself arrived here a moment ago.

00:10:50.330 --> 00:10:51.540
Lord Pricket...

00:10:51.960 --> 00:10:54.880
All of you onlookers, move further back!

00:10:54.880 --> 00:10:57.130
It is important to preserve the scene!

00:10:57.830 --> 00:11:01.750
Now, allow me to show you
some of my very finest magic.

00:11:02.500 --> 00:11:03.710
"Magic"?

00:11:04.170 --> 00:11:07.830
This is one of my revolutionary inventions:

00:11:07.830 --> 00:11:10.830
A volatile agent that traces back to any sign of mana.

00:11:10.830 --> 00:11:11.830
That is to say...

00:11:12.000 --> 00:11:16.040
It will reproduce for us whoever it
was that was present at the scene.

00:11:36.540 --> 00:11:39.420
This is the mana of the culprit!

00:11:40.210 --> 00:11:41.460
That color is...

00:11:42.380 --> 00:11:46.460
This mana is... Yes, it comes from a male.

00:11:46.460 --> 00:11:48.290
One who's around the age of becoming an adult...

00:11:48.670 --> 00:11:50.580
No, one in their teens.

00:11:56.790 --> 00:11:58.500
The one thing I can say is...

00:11:59.330 --> 00:12:01.750
as for ways to prove my innocence...

00:12:02.170 --> 00:12:03.420
I have none.

00:12:24.420 --> 00:12:25.250
Lita...

00:12:25.750 --> 00:12:28.670
What do you think it is the culprit wants to accomplish?

00:12:29.040 --> 00:12:31.000
You mean the blue-flamed culprit?

00:12:31.170 --> 00:12:32.000
Yeah.

00:12:32.580 --> 00:12:37.500
They said that schoolgirl lost consciousness
but didn't have any visible injuries.

00:12:38.880 --> 00:12:40.830
What was it the offender wanted to do?

00:12:41.290 --> 00:12:42.880
I don't know...

00:12:49.290 --> 00:12:53.920
First time seeing an aurora and lightening,
is it, my little birdies?

00:12:54.330 --> 00:12:56.880
That sight is one of the things my town is known for.

00:12:57.330 --> 00:13:01.710
Is it possible the lightening is getting so dangerous
the train won't be able to head back home?

00:13:26.130 --> 00:13:28.830
Now this is Shangarta!

00:13:28.830 --> 00:13:30.460
It's a paradise in the depths of the earth.

00:13:33.460 --> 00:13:37.500
Due to the gene-manipulation
technology I've brought forth,

00:13:37.500 --> 00:13:41.960
this subterranean land is now
brimming with a variety of greenery.

00:13:43.750 --> 00:13:45.080
Rare flowers!

00:13:45.420 --> 00:13:47.080
Tenacious crops!

00:13:48.080 --> 00:13:50.500
You can't see these back in Flandore!

00:13:50.830 --> 00:13:52.920
We've allowed them make their way inside!

00:13:53.960 --> 00:13:55.750
They've made it all the way here, have they?

00:13:56.210 --> 00:13:59.380
As a side effect of the experimentation,
 a huge forest has taken...

00:13:56.710 --> 00:13:57.580
The sound of water...?

00:14:01.750 --> 00:14:04.750
That voice I heard was coming from
the far side of this boulder...

00:14:07.710 --> 00:14:10.960
Milady, have you grown tired of the lecture?

00:14:11.460 --> 00:14:12.580
Instructor...

00:14:13.080 --> 00:14:13.630
No!

00:14:14.540 --> 00:14:16.040
Stay away from there!

00:14:17.380 --> 00:14:19.420
This area is a mystery spot!

00:14:19.420 --> 00:14:22.000
It's a world in which conventional
wisdom does not apply!

00:14:22.000 --> 00:14:23.330
"Mystery spot"...?

00:14:23.960 --> 00:14:26.170
Due to a strong kink in the magnetic field,

00:14:26.170 --> 00:14:30.630
there is a spot that produces an uncanny
effect that goes against all common sense.

00:14:30.630 --> 00:14:31.790
Blossom!

00:14:32.710 --> 00:14:35.460
Oh, Dick! My future son!

00:14:35.500 --> 00:14:37.170
You've come at a great time.

00:14:37.380 --> 00:14:39.210
This here is the true fiancé of-

00:14:39.210 --> 00:14:40.670
M-more importantly, Blossom...

00:14:41.210 --> 00:14:42.380
Someone else has come down with it!

00:14:46.040 --> 00:14:47.380
No!

00:14:47.380 --> 00:14:49.920
Carnell! Carnell!

00:14:50.500 --> 00:14:52.670
Those not versed in these things, step back!

00:14:53.040 --> 00:14:54.130
Carnell!

00:14:58.710 --> 00:15:00.540
Pathology Progression A.

00:15:00.880 --> 00:15:01.880
It's too late for him.

00:15:01.880 --> 00:15:03.540
Provide him with salvation!

00:15:09.080 --> 00:15:10.580
No!

00:15:10.670 --> 00:15:12.330
Stop!

00:15:14.330 --> 00:15:14.900
Carnell!

00:15:14.900 --> 00:15:17.330
And with that, his soul's been saved!

00:15:17.460 --> 00:15:18.580
Lord Pricket!

00:15:18.920 --> 00:15:20.630
What is the meaning of this?!

00:15:20.960 --> 00:15:23.460
Conducting a public execution is a serious crime.

00:15:23.750 --> 00:15:25.540
An execution?

00:15:25.540 --> 00:15:26.790
Far from it!

00:15:27.130 --> 00:15:28.670
This is salvation.

00:15:28.830 --> 00:15:31.000
He was stricken with a disease.

00:15:31.000 --> 00:15:31.920
"A disease"?

00:15:32.130 --> 00:15:34.750
It's a rare illness that has been raging here in Shangarta.

00:15:34.920 --> 00:15:39.880
One loses their rational faculties and is reduced
to a monster that desires only to slaughter.

00:15:39.880 --> 00:15:41.250
Therefore...

00:15:41.500 --> 00:15:46.330
We promptly put down any individuals
the diseases has progressed in.

00:15:48.920 --> 00:15:50.330
This town is rather...

00:15:51.210 --> 00:15:51.960
bizarre.

00:15:59.210 --> 00:16:01.330
Papa is also the administrator of this place.

00:16:02.830 --> 00:16:04.880
Sorry for dragging you into this whole ordeal.

00:16:05.710 --> 00:16:08.880
I thought you'd for sure turn down
playing the role of my lover.

00:16:11.000 --> 00:16:13.250
Why did you help me out, anyway?

00:16:15.130 --> 00:16:16.630
"Big Sis" Rosetti!

00:16:17.290 --> 00:16:18.630
Welcome home!

00:16:18.630 --> 00:16:20.540
Oh, you little rascals!

00:16:20.540 --> 00:16:21.750
Have you been good children?

00:16:21.750 --> 00:16:23.040
Yes!

00:16:23.580 --> 00:16:25.460
Quite a merry family you've got there.

00:16:25.830 --> 00:16:29.830
Well, Papa doesn't discriminate when
it comes to kids who've lost all relatives.

00:16:29.920 --> 00:16:30.880
"Big Sis"!

00:16:30.880 --> 00:16:32.290
How long you staying this time?

00:16:32.290 --> 00:16:33.130
Come play with us!

00:16:35.000 --> 00:16:35.830
You know...

00:16:36.670 --> 00:16:39.000
My memories from my childhood are pretty vague.

00:16:40.460 --> 00:16:43.040
But, I've been told I lost my family.

00:16:45.880 --> 00:16:48.250
Given the kind of place Shangarta is though...

00:16:48.880 --> 00:16:50.830
Such a thing isn't uncommon.

00:16:52.040 --> 00:16:57.630
Papa takes in children who, like me, have no
relatives, and he provides them with a new family.

00:16:58.580 --> 00:17:00.250
That's a quite fine thing, I'd say.

00:17:00.790 --> 00:17:02.630
Yeah, I think so, too.

00:17:04.630 --> 00:17:07.880
Apparently, Papa himself lost
his own wife a long time ago.

00:17:08.250 --> 00:17:10.540
"Big Sis" Rosetti, who's that man?

00:17:11.000 --> 00:17:12.420
My fiancé!

00:17:14.330 --> 00:17:17.630
Your big sis has brought her boyfriend back to our home!

00:17:22.080 --> 00:17:26.130
Seems you had a leisurely fun time, huh, Instructor?!

00:17:26.420 --> 00:17:28.210
Are you angry with me?

00:17:28.210 --> 00:17:29.500
About what?

00:17:29.750 --> 00:17:31.790
Here's a question for you, Instructor.

00:17:31.790 --> 00:17:34.380
What do you think it is I'm mad about?

00:17:34.460 --> 00:17:38.460
Could it be because I left you here by
yourself and headed out somewhere?

00:17:38.880 --> 00:17:39.750
Instructor.

00:17:40.210 --> 00:17:42.540
Please take out some socks and put them on me.

00:17:58.000 --> 00:18:00.380
You're not mindful of the fact that I'm a girl anyway,

00:18:00.630 --> 00:18:02.210
so I might as well have you help me change clothes.

00:18:02.880 --> 00:18:05.130
After all, I'm just a child in your eyes.

00:18:05.960 --> 00:18:07.000
Milady.

00:18:07.000 --> 00:18:08.330
What is it?!

00:18:08.500 --> 00:18:11.380
What do you say to going out
on a date with me right now?

00:18:13.040 --> 00:18:15.380
"A d-date"?

00:18:21.380 --> 00:18:23.880
I'm out on a middle-of-the-night date with my instructor!

00:18:37.830 --> 00:18:41.170
I really wanted to show you this place, milady.

00:18:48.380 --> 00:18:51.880
Actually, this limestone cave has an interesting trick to it.

00:19:09.540 --> 00:19:11.670
This is one of the so-called mystery spots.

00:19:12.170 --> 00:19:15.330
The surrounding rocks are strongly magnetized,

00:19:15.710 --> 00:19:19.040
and within a certain area they produce
something much like weightlessness.

00:19:19.040 --> 00:19:20.040
"Magnetized," you say?

00:19:20.290 --> 00:19:24.960
Weightlessness also makes for
an effective training environment.

00:19:25.290 --> 00:19:26.710
Is that right?

00:19:27.130 --> 00:19:28.790
You see, in order to maintain your balance,

00:19:28.790 --> 00:19:31.500
you rely on muscles you normally don't use.

00:19:31.920 --> 00:19:35.960
Even in your room, it's possible to recreate something
like weightlessness by using a hammock.

00:19:36.210 --> 00:19:38.040
How about we give it a try when we return home?

00:19:43.880 --> 00:19:47.710
Instructor, why is that you know about this place?

00:19:48.330 --> 00:19:51.080
I've previously come to this town for a mission.

00:19:51.080 --> 00:19:52.210
"A mission"?

00:20:19.420 --> 00:20:23.130
Instructor, will you take me on a date again sometime?

00:20:24.630 --> 00:20:26.130
Any place is fine...

00:20:26.130 --> 00:20:28.000
so long as it's together with you.

00:20:28.670 --> 00:20:29.710
Milady...

00:20:29.790 --> 00:20:32.540
I'm sorry for being selfish earlier today.

00:20:32.540 --> 00:20:36.170
I just... wanted to pester you a bit.

00:20:38.880 --> 00:20:41.210
I guess I'm a bit odd.

00:20:41.630 --> 00:20:44.290
I want to be the only one who's acquainted with you.

00:20:44.290 --> 00:20:47.960
I know it's a childish and selfish...

00:20:59.580 --> 00:21:04.830
You're the first person to ever
feel that way about me, milady.

00:21:05.790 --> 00:21:06.420
Which is why...

00:21:07.580 --> 00:21:10.880
I'm not sure what I should do.

00:22:56.420 --> 00:22:57.380
What is this place?

00:22:58.580 --> 00:23:00.210
Instructor, where are you?

00:23:00.750 --> 00:23:03.540
I want it... I want it...

00:23:03.540 --> 00:23:05.580
I want blood!

00:23:05.790 --> 00:23:06.880
That voice...

00:23:07.170 --> 00:23:08.580
Give me your blood!

00:23:09.580 --> 00:23:11.920
What was that dream just now?

00:23:11.920 --> 00:23:13.670
I feel very unwell.

00:23:13.670 --> 00:23:15.710
Lita! Lita! Are you awake?!

00:23:15.710 --> 00:23:17.790
Elli? You can come on in.

00:23:18.170 --> 00:23:20.540
Lita! Someone has been attacked again!

00:23:20.710 --> 00:23:22.380
By that blue-flamed criminal!

00:23:36.040 --> 00:23:40.960
Next Episode
The Last Testament of a Certain Skeleton
